# Rust build cache only. The generated wasm pkg under src/wasm/ is committed on
# purpose (tiny, and keeps `npm run check` / dev build-free): its .d.ts must stay
# visible to svelte-check, which honors .gitignore. `npm run wasm` also deletes the
# `*`-only .gitignore wasm-pack writes into each out-dir for the same reason.
target/

